# UI Design Patterns

## Page Layout Structure
Follow this consistent layout pattern for all pages:

```razor
<div class="container">
    <div class="intro-text">
        <p>*Character introduction*</p>
        <p>Description and instructions</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <img class="character-image" src="images/character.png" alt="Character" />
        <div class="upload-box">
            <!-- File upload area -->
        </div>
        <div class="upload-text">
            <textarea @oninput="UpdateText"></textarea>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="crystal-ball">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="Submit">Get Prediction</button>
        <p>Prediction message</p>
        <textarea class="prediction-text" readonly>@prediction</textarea>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Optional carousel -->
</div>
```

## Theming Guidelines
- **Regular Pets**: Default styling with wizard theme
- **Plants**: Light blue background (`#f0f8ff`) with plant sage
- **Mythical**: Purple gradient with golden accents and dragon theme

## File Upload Pattern
- Use `InputFile` component with `OnChange="HandleFileSelected"`
- Generate preview URLs with base64 encoding
- Show confirmation text for successful uploads
- Handle both image and text input

## Button Styling
- Primary buttons use `btn btn-primary`
- Include hover effects and transitions
- Use descriptive text (e.g., "Get Mystical Prediction")

## Carousel Implementation
- Use Bootstrap carousel with `data-ride="carousel"`
- Include prev/next controls
- Use descriptive alt text for images
- Place at bottom of page content